  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteInteractable
  prompt: Interact
  noteTitle: In the photographer's handwriting
  body: "My sitters never age in my photographs. Only in this room.\n\nI locked the
    darkroom key in the cabinet. The faces on the north wall keep the combination
    \u2014 but you won't read it with your eyes. Use the lens.\n\nTake them in the
    order they were born.\n\n\u2014 M."
  flagOnRead: read_studio
  objectiveOnRead: Open the cabinet. The portraits hide the combination.
  hintOnRead: 
